Steps:
[NAV] {{BACK_URL}}/ui/graphiql/sales-rep
[WAIT] GraphiQL editor loaded (scoped sales-rep schema)
[AUTH] role=ACME_BUYER — POST {{BACK_URL}}/connect/token with ACME_BUYER credentials — MUST include the form param storeId ({{STORE_ID}}; use {{STORE_ID_SECONDARY}} for a rep bound to the secondary store): store-bound rep/buyer accounts return HTTP 400 invalid_grant without it (verified vcptcore-qa 2026-07-16); insert "Authorization: Bearer <token>" in the Headers tab via execCommand('insertText') (graphiql-interaction.md Step 2)
[ACT] (main) open a new tab; click query editor; type:
query {
  customerSalesReps {
    totalCount
    pageInfo { hasNextPage hasPreviousPage startCursor endCursor }
    items { id firstName lastName middleName fullName name about photoUrl emails phones }
  }
}
[GQL] (main) execute (Ctrl+Enter)
